WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.260
Copied from 25

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:10.860
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.670
<i>Team Koshiro, 32 points.</i>

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:07.490
<i>Team Ichigo, 31 points.</i>

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:10.400
<i>Result: Team Koshiro wins.</i>

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:16.410
<i>That's a big victory!</i>

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:17.590
<i>We lost...</i>

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:18.510
<i>That can't be...</i>

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:19.720
<i>That means, Kashino...</i>

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:21.620
<i>W-What?</i>

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:27.130
<i>Prepare yourself, Makoto-kun!</i>

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:34.330
<i>You belong to me now. I'll never let go of you!</i>

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:55.100
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:55.100
