nakitaku natte mo egao ni nareru mahou

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:48.070
Even if you cry, there is magic that can make you smile.

00:01:48.070 --> 00:01:53.290
「oishii<i>!」 wo tsukurutte omoikkiri tanoshii ne</i>

00:01:48.070 --> 00:01:53.290
「Delicious<i>!</i>」 and making it wholeheartedly is fun.

00:01:53.290 --> 00:01:59.290
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:01:53.290 --> 00:01:59.290
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffiness, so sweetly it melts.

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:04.630
shiawase wo ageru yo yumeiro no pâtishièeru<i>!!</i>

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:04.630
I'll give happiness to you, the dream-coloured Pâtissière<i>!!</i>

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:09.180
ichigo furejie & furanbowaazu, hapihapi makaron, fun fun

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:09.180
Strawberry Fraisier & Framboise, happy happy Macaron, fun, fun

00:02:09.180 --> 00:02:11.400
yume ni eeru<i>!</i>

00:02:09.180 --> 00:02:11.400
Get them in our dreams<i>!</i>

00:02:11.650 --> 00:02:15.880
Presented by Wasurenai-subs

00:02:16.710 --> 00:02:23.290
Good morning. Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:02:28.190 --> 00:02:32.220
It's a holiday, yet we have to practice this early in the morning...

00:02:32.220 --> 00:02:33.590
What are you saying, Vanilla?

00:02:34.900 --> 00:02:41.990
We did lose to Koshiro-san, but as long as we win the match for 3rd place, we can get back to challenge the Grand Prix.

00:02:41.990 --> 00:02:44.510
So we have to practice more than usual!

00:02:44.510 --> 00:02:47.270
Besides, this time, Team Ichigo has...

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:48.590
Kashino.

00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:50.800
Yo.

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:55.030
Are you really going to join Team Koshiro?

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:00.920
I promised that I'd join them if I lost.

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:03.530
Once I'm there, I'll definitely do my best.

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:04.400
Kashino...

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:07.210
Makoto-kun! Found you!

00:03:07.210 --> 00:03:09.630
From now on, you're part of Team Koshiro.

00:03:09.630 --> 00:03:11.500
Oh no, this feels like a dream.

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:14.880
For Kashino to not be bothered by Koshiro-san...

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:17.510
We're leaving by car. Hurry up and let's go.

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:20.940
Work hard, Amano.

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:24.370
There they go...

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:28.020
Dar-ling! Hurry up!

00:03:28.630 --> 00:03:32.120
Team Ichigo doesn't have Kashino now...

00:03:33.010 --> 00:03:39.020
recipe 26

00:03:33.010 --> 00:03:39.020
Nightmare of Ojou's Empire<i>!</i>

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:35.650
Nightmare of Ojou's Empire!

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:42.530
I can smell almond...

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:45.830
Ayukawa-san! Are you practicing making marzipan?

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:48.020
You're really early. When did you come here?

00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:49.330
5 o'clock.

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:50.650
That's really early...

00:03:50.650 --> 00:03:54.040
Huh? I thought Koshiro-san came and picked you up already...

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:55.410
Eh? Really?

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:57.710
I'll clean this up, so hurry up and go.

00:03:58.160 --> 00:03:59.000
Eh?

00:04:00.860 --> 00:04:02.470
Then, please do.

00:04:03.830 --> 00:04:08.180
Wasn't that girl the one who stole your design? Why are you helping her?

00:04:08.780 --> 00:04:11.050
Is this the cake you're making for the Grand Prix?

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:16.150
The base is a Sachertorte. I figured I'll decorate it with lots of love.

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:21.280
<i>Ayukawa-san, why would you do something like this?</i>

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:24.780
<i>Did you talk to me just to steal my cake design!?</i>

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:25.760
<i>What are you talking about?</i>

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:27.980
<i>But that's my design!</i>

00:04:27.980 --> 00:04:30.750
<i>Stop accusing others. Do you have proof?</i>

00:04:31.220 --> 00:04:33.300
We had no proof at all.

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:37.970
Even without that, it's obvious they stole it! It's better to just ignore her.

00:04:38.780 --> 00:04:40.970
Done... If we run, we might get to her in time.

00:04:42.560 --> 00:04:44.030
I'll leave the rest to you.

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:46.320
Huh!?

00:04:47.460 --> 00:04:49.180
Geez, Ichigo...

00:04:51.710 --> 00:04:54.230
Ojou-sama, I'm sorry for being late.

00:04:56.360 --> 00:05:02.450
Yohko. I forgot to tell you this. Since Makoto-kun has joined, you'll be a substitute from today on.

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:06.660
Therefore, I would like you to devote yourself to your forte, to collect information.

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:09.660
I want to find out what the next theme is as soon as possible.

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:11.720
Yes, Ojou-sama.

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:16.170
Umm...

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:19.660
This is the marzipan you made earlier...

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:22.970
You thought this serves me right, didn't you?

00:05:22.970 --> 00:05:26.220
I used such dirty tricks to let Team Koshiro win.

00:05:27.210 --> 00:05:28.890
Now I'm just a substitute...

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:31.000
I don't want your pity.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:31.920
I wasn't-

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:35.060
I... even after this all happened, I definitely won't give up!

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:37.260
Ayukawa-san...

00:05:42.160 --> 00:05:45.780
It's a bother when he's here, but when he isn't here, it feels weird.

00:05:46.310 --> 00:05:49.290
Will he really be able to handle Koshiro-san's team?

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:52.790
<i>Since Makoto-kun has joined, you'll be a substitute from today on.</i>

00:05:53.480 --> 00:05:58.570
Hey, if Kashino is snatched away, how are you going to take part in the match for 3rd place?

00:05:58.570 --> 00:05:59.750
That's right.

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:02.640
Is there someone who can replace him?

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:04.250
<i>A person to replace him?</i>

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:06.950
Do we have any person that can replace Kashino?

00:06:06.950 --> 00:06:08.470
We don't need anyone to replace him.

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:11.050
We're waiting for him to return.

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:11.600
Eh?

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:12.470
Really?

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:16.190
Koshiro-san said that she would definitely not let him go, though...

00:06:16.190 --> 00:06:18.400
<i>Work hard, Amano.</i>

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:20.690
Kashino has probably prepared for this.

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:23.910
It feels like he won't come back.

00:06:23.910 --> 00:06:27.580
That's the reason why you looked really depressed a while ago, Ichigo-chan.

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:29.410
Are you that worried about Kashino?

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:33.600
W-What are you saying? It's not like that. I...

00:06:36.570 --> 00:06:37.900
How nice teasing you.

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:40.420
That's so cute, Ichigo-chan.

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:42.800
Eh? Was I teased!?

00:06:46.530 --> 00:06:48.800
<i>If Kashino really comes back, then...</i>

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:53.310
<i>...Ayukawa-san will be able to get back to her group officially as a member, wouldn't she?</i>

00:06:58.970 --> 00:07:02.360
It's quite amazing that the academy has this equipment.

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:05.310
As expected from the greatness of Château confectionery's mistress, isn't it?

00:07:05.810 --> 00:07:08.910
How is it, Makoto-kun? About my home's ultra-fine equipment here.

00:07:08.910 --> 00:07:11.390
You can use it like it's yours.

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:13.740
I'll tell you this.

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:18.920
If you use dirty tricks like stealing someone else's design and calling a professional in, I won't forgive you.

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:22.420
Oh my! Makoto-kun is just too cool~

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:24.130
I want to be together with you everywhere!

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:26.270
I'm suffocating!

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:28.630
Senpai, are you serious about getting work done!?

00:07:34.230 --> 00:07:37.460
Do you know the theme for the tournament finals?

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:41.310
Yes. The chairman announced it to the teachers just a while ago.

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:42.850
The theme is "Zipang".

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:43.980
Zipang?

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:48.030
Are you sure of that?

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:50.820
Yes. It's for the finals.

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:51.740
Good job.

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:55.740
If it's about Zipang, then that's from "The Travels of Marco Polo"!

00:07:55.740 --> 00:08:00.580
In that book, he introduced Japan as "The Golden Country, Zipang."

00:08:01.550 --> 00:08:07.800
Golden country? Then let's go all out and make really gorgeous sweets using even real gold this time!

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:10.160
That'd be taking the easy route, wouldn't it?

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:16.220
Also, since Marco Polo never actually set foot in Japan, sparkling golden sweets would be way off the mark.

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:19.630
Wow! My Makoto-kun really knows everything.

00:08:19.630 --> 00:08:21.730
That's common knowledge!

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:24.270
I would think what's important here is not the history...

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:30.280
...but to see what kind of sweets we can create that evoke the image of the name, Zipang.

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:34.240
Ayukawa... She got it quite on the mark.

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:35.880
Image...

00:08:36.440 --> 00:08:41.230
That's right! It's to measure how great our imaginations are and how well we can express them through making sweets!

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:44.960
Makoto-kun! The one who has that ability is you.

00:08:44.970 --> 00:08:45.740
Huh?

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:47.920
Am I doing this alone?

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:51.980
We will do it to our utmost best too!

00:08:51.980 --> 00:08:53.890
After all, you're a member of Team Koshiro.

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:56.320
Then, let's think about this together.

00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:56.890
Yes!

00:08:57.380 --> 00:09:01.390
<i>They're completely submissive to Ojou... This is like...</i>

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:07.400
...<i>Ojou's Empire!</i>

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:14.180
Darling! I'll see you tomorrow!

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:22.610
We really worked hard today, didn't we?

00:09:22.610 --> 00:09:23.210
Yeah.

00:09:23.210 --> 00:09:24.160
Huh?

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:25.380
That is...

00:09:25.380 --> 00:09:26.880
Kashino and Chocolat!

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:30.400
Kashino!

00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:31.570
Good job.

00:09:31.570 --> 00:09:32.750
How was it?

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:34.470
I survived somehow...

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:38.240
Andou. I need you to tell me about Japanese confections.

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:39.970
Japanese confections? Sure.

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:43.270
Then, we'll see you tomorrow, Ichigo-chan.

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:44.650
Yeah. Later.

00:09:45.120 --> 00:09:46.920
Hey, how was it?

00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:48.690
Was Kashino okay?

00:09:49.160 --> 00:09:52.640
Kashino didn't resist Ojou at all.

00:09:52.640 --> 00:09:55.980
And he's really working his best in that team.

00:09:55.980 --> 00:09:58.700
That means he really might not come back.

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:01.390
<i>Kashino won't come back?</i>

00:10:01.390 --> 00:10:04.370
<i>At this rate, will Team Ichigo really be fine?</i>

00:10:06.380 --> 00:10:08.850
<i>Also, there's Ayukawa-san...</i>

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:14.570
<i>I won't sit by and let something like this happen.</i>

00:10:15.180 --> 00:10:17.890
<i>I definitely won't give up.</i>

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:38.650
Zipang, is it?

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:42.580
So that's why Kashino asked you for help with Japanese confections.

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:43.600
Yeah.

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:46.250
But that means he's going all out, right?

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:49.000
Do you still think he will come back?

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:52.330
Kashino really hates to do things half-assed.

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:54.550
Well, let's just sit back and wait.

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:57.140
Do you think I can sit back!?

00:10:57.140 --> 00:10:58.720
Ichigo! The white batter is...

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:02.970
That's splendid work.

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:04.220
It's total mutilation.

00:11:08.970 --> 00:11:10.810
Everyone, do your best!

00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:13.940
I will use the best idea that you all come up with.

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:17.450
But it's already been decided that the best one will be Makoto-kun's though.

00:11:18.090 --> 00:11:22.150
Stop bothering me! How about you come up with an idea of your own!?

00:11:22.150 --> 00:11:25.240
Oh! But I'm the leader.

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:30.840
It's a leader's d-u-t-y be with Kashino and let everyone's ideas to take form.

00:11:31.450 --> 00:11:33.430
Why is it always together with me?

00:11:33.430 --> 00:11:36.020
Because that's what love is.

00:11:37.490 --> 00:11:40.120
Makoto-kun really knows nothing about love.

00:11:40.120 --> 00:11:42.390
That's why I made sure you'd lose.

00:11:43.210 --> 00:11:46.260
Kashino, that hit a spot where it really hurts, didn't it?

00:11:46.880 --> 00:11:48.940
Darling! I have high expectations of you.

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:51.650
You, take this!! Helmbreaker!

00:11:51.650 --> 00:11:54.360
And another Helm-

00:11:57.600 --> 00:11:59.370
Oh, darling~

00:12:06.290 --> 00:12:07.580
And now, time to eat it.

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:09.250
Yay~

00:12:13.360 --> 00:12:15.470
<i>I also cut a share for Kashino...</i>

00:12:21.390 --> 00:12:22.160
Done.

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:23.470
It looks good.

00:12:27.270 --> 00:12:32.500
I based mine on tea ceremony, with the hint of hard candy. It's a Waffle cookie.

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:36.230
Oh? The colour looks pretty.

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:43.200
Makoto-kun, take a bite.

00:12:51.680 --> 00:12:54.710
What did you put in the cookies? It's totally dried out.

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:57.510
I wonder if I put too much soya flour.

00:12:57.510 --> 00:12:58.620
Yeah.

00:12:59.110 --> 00:13:01.490
The texture and the smell are totally terrible.

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:03.800
Alright then, next. Shiotani.

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:04.430
Yes.

00:13:06.230 --> 00:13:07.290
What's this?

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:10.830
Kudzu starch cake, right? Since it's so hard.

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:14.050
The sponge and cream doesn't fit well together at all.

00:13:14.050 --> 00:13:15.580
No good, huh...

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:16.940
Next! Yohko!

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:20.950
Waffles? It looks plain.

00:13:24.140 --> 00:13:25.450
So sweet!

00:13:26.190 --> 00:13:31.340
To start with, waffle itself is sweet. The chocolate cream inside makes it even sweeter.

00:13:31.340 --> 00:13:32.170
As I thought...

00:13:32.650 --> 00:13:36.380
If you got an idea, improve on this.
Like using cacao mass or something.

00:13:36.380 --> 00:13:38.170
Cacao, you say?

00:13:39.010 --> 00:13:41.470
But the waffle's texture is good though...

00:13:41.470 --> 00:13:46.090
I realise that you used dorayaki batter as the base, but did you add anything else in it?

00:13:47.590 --> 00:13:48.600
Tapioca flour.

00:13:48.600 --> 00:13:51.810
You really have thought over on the recipe.

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:53.280
Thank you very much.

00:13:53.280 --> 00:13:54.600
But, you fail.

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:55.800
Yes.

00:13:58.170 --> 00:14:00.830
As I thought, the best one is made by my darling.

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:02.610
Look, it's marvelous, isn't it?

00:14:03.970 --> 00:14:06.120
What ingredients do you think I used to make this?

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:09.770
Oh? The outer layer is mochi?

00:14:09.770 --> 00:14:11.010
It's a Turkish delight.

00:14:11.010 --> 00:14:14.260
I got the idea from the springy texture of mochi used in Japanese confections.

00:14:14.260 --> 00:14:17.960
The maccha and sponge really match each other well.

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:21.080
The azuki cream you added is really good too.

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:22.130
Delicious...

00:14:23.510 --> 00:14:26.640
As expected of you. It's decided!

00:14:26.640 --> 00:14:31.890
We will use Makoto-kun's cake as the base. And I will think of a gorgeous design!

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:33.790
With that it'll be perfect!

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:36.150
Yes, Ojou-sama. It'll be perfect!

00:14:36.150 --> 00:14:37.760
My, oh my...

00:14:37.760 --> 00:14:40.800
The first stage of Ojou's empire is cleared, is it?

00:14:41.460 --> 00:14:43.650
You did really well, Kashino.

00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:45.990
Ah...

00:14:46.540 --> 00:14:50.660
I wish they hurry up and decide on a theme for the match for 3rd place.

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:55.930
That's true. The finals' theme has already been decided...

00:14:56.610 --> 00:14:58.350
Oh? Ayukawa-san.

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:01.260
Umm...

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:04.910
She sends chills down my spines...

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:05.680
Amano!

00:15:05.680 --> 00:15:06.480
Eh?

00:15:07.110 --> 00:15:08.170
Ah, Kashino!

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:10.560
Ayukawa-san?

00:15:10.560 --> 00:15:14.680
Yeah. I thought she was merely a spy for Ojou, but...

00:15:15.670 --> 00:15:16.700
...how was her personality?

00:15:17.020 --> 00:15:20.030
I'm not really sure myself...

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:24.900
...but even though she's a substitute, it seems she practices lots in the cooking classroom.

00:15:26.770 --> 00:15:30.420
Today, she went into the classroom in the middle of the night, too.

00:15:30.420 --> 00:15:31.080
You're right.

00:15:32.430 --> 00:15:34.830
This time we'll be the spies!

00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:42.200
If I put in too much cacao mass, it will become bitter.

00:15:57.210 --> 00:16:00.020
She's making Chocolate Custard Cream.

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:02.940
She followed what Kashino said and added in cacao mass.

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:03.530
See!

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:12.850
Wow, it's delicious! The balance between the cacao mass and chocolate added into the custard cream is perfect.

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:18.210
<i>That's right. By just hearing that line, she is able to improve this much...</i>

00:16:19.280 --> 00:16:22.010
She is able to make such delicious sweets.

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:24.460
And if the group uses Kashino's sweet for the match...

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:27.030
...then she won't be able to become an official member of the group...

00:16:27.030 --> 00:16:27.790
Yeah.

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:34.880
It's still lacking something...

00:16:52.090 --> 00:16:55.120
Kashino. That girl bought "that" with her.

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:58.240
Did you perfect those waffles?

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:00.080
Eh? What are you doing!?

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:20.680
Makoto-kun! I've designed a splendid Zipang for you!

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:21.640
Look at this!

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:24.940
How is the design?

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:27.520
I put my feelings for you into the Zipang!

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:28.440
This is lame.

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:29.290
This is unnecessary.

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:30.250
We don't need these.

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:30.910
This makes no sense.

00:17:30.910 --> 00:17:32.240
Seriously...

00:17:35.870 --> 00:17:36.810
Ojou-sama!

00:17:36.810 --> 00:17:37.540
Please calm down!

00:17:39.550 --> 00:17:40.690
I'm fine.

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:49.190
Darling, you really have an ego. But that's what makes you cute.

00:17:49.190 --> 00:17:52.240
You can do whatever you want. Just name it.

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:55.760
Koshiro-senpai! Please hand over the leader position to me.

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:56.960
Yes!?

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:59.560
Kashino! What have you said to Ojou-sama...

00:17:59.560 --> 00:18:00.470
You are being really rude to her!

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:04.120
I have finally gotten out of Team Ichigo.

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:06.480
This time, I want to have my own team.

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:08.140
Makoto-kun...

00:18:08.610 --> 00:18:13.010
Satou, Shiotani, Ayukawa. After the design is decided, lend me a hand.

00:18:13.010 --> 00:18:14.070
Y-Yeah...

00:18:14.650 --> 00:18:18.960
No way! Don't do anything as you please without me permitting it first.

00:18:19.380 --> 00:18:21.660
W-What is it, darling?

00:18:22.100 --> 00:18:25.880
Because you said it yourself. That I can do whatever I want.

00:18:26.440 --> 00:18:28.480
That's true, but...

00:18:29.570 --> 00:18:32.090
Then, what do you want me to do?

00:18:32.790 --> 00:18:36.280
Senpai, you will be the <i>substitute</i>!

00:18:39.490 --> 00:18:40.680
Substitute...

00:18:41.170 --> 00:18:46.310
Koshiro-senpai, you should just sit back, and eat this.

00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:47.110
Makoto-

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:53.830
What's this? It's delicious.

00:18:53.830 --> 00:18:56.930
The chocolate is refreshing yet it doesn't lose its richness.

00:18:56.930 --> 00:19:00.020
The outer layer is crunchy, while the inside is full of springiness.

00:19:01.350 --> 00:19:01.950
Yohko?

00:19:02.580 --> 00:19:04.740
Did you make this?

00:19:05.810 --> 00:19:06.340
Yes.

00:19:06.850 --> 00:19:09.950
You've improved so much in just one night.

00:19:10.990 --> 00:19:12.160
Thank you very much.

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:17.880
Makoto-kun.

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:24.160
I believed that if I was together with you, my loved one, I'd be able to make the best sweets.

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:26.900
But it seems I was wrong.

00:19:27.580 --> 00:19:29.740
Sorry to say this, but you're...

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:32.110
...fired.

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:41.150
No matter how much I love Makoto-kun, I won't give in to your wishes of handing the team over to you.

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:46.010
Why? Because my very existence is the Team Koshiro.

00:19:46.880 --> 00:19:48.340
Ojou-sama!

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:50.130
"Banzai for the Ojou Empire!", is it?

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:52.770
Then I'll be excusing myself.

00:19:59.600 --> 00:20:01.390
So then, we're going to redo it!

00:20:01.390 --> 00:20:02.040
Yes.

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:06.410
Yohko. This time we'll use your idea to attain victory.

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:08.140
So without a moment to waste, let's think of a design together.

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:09.240
Yes!

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:15.640
Escape successful, right?

00:20:17.030 --> 00:20:18.160
Kashino-kun.

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:21.910
Umm... I... how do I say it...

00:20:23.150 --> 00:20:24.660
Thank you.

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:29.890
Don't be mistaken. I was only freeing myself from Ojou.

00:20:31.150 --> 00:20:32.670
Well, good luck.

00:20:37.220 --> 00:20:38.180
Kashino.

00:20:40.530 --> 00:20:41.690
Welcome back!

00:20:42.290 --> 00:20:43.180
Kashino!

00:20:47.500 --> 00:20:50.680
Let's do our best on the match for 3rd place.

00:20:50.680 --> 00:20:51.520
Yeah!

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:54.650
Makoto-kuuuun!

00:20:56.600 --> 00:20:59.820
Be sure to win in the match for 3rd place.

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:01.730
I'll be waiting for you at the final selection of the Cake Grand Prix.

00:21:02.250 --> 00:21:03.230
Koshiro-san.

