Dream-coloured Magical Essence!

00:23:03.820 --> 00:23:05.270
Cacao mass.

00:23:08.760 --> 00:23:15.880
Cacao mass, being the raw material for chocolate powder, is used in low-sugar chocolate.

00:23:15.880 --> 00:23:18.170
It's also known as bitter chocolate.

00:23:18.170 --> 00:23:20.960
The cacao, being the raw material to produce chocolate,

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:23.930
is grown in middle-east America, which is brimming of sunlight.

00:23:23.930 --> 00:23:28.290
It's the seeds gathered from the cacao fruits on the cacao tree.

00:23:30.350 --> 00:23:34.040
Roast these cacao seeds, remove the skin, crush the pit and mound it into a paste.

00:23:34.040 --> 00:23:38.180
This will then make cacao mass.

00:23:39.030 --> 00:23:42.740
The dark liquor has an unique bitterness.

00:23:43.590 --> 00:23:49.150
By adding these liquor into chocolate sweets, it will have a different chocolate taste.

00:23:49.150 --> 00:23:52.270
And you will be able to enjoy the original flavour of cacao.

00:23:53.500 --> 00:23:58.460
We are able to make many different kinds of chocolate sweets because there is cacao mass.

00:24:00.760 --> 00:24:02.530
Eh!? Repeat a year!?

00:24:02.530 --> 00:24:03.710
You all still don't know about that!?

00:24:03.710 --> 00:24:06.210
But if we go back to the Kingdom of Sweets and take the examinations...

00:24:06.210 --> 00:24:07.630
...until we pass it, we won't be able to return here.

00:24:07.640 --> 00:24:11.800
I don't want that! I'm sure it will be a hundred years before I can go back!

00:24:11.800 --> 00:24:14.410
By then, Andou will have become a grandpa!

00:24:14.410 --> 00:24:15.640
Anyway, we just have to do this.

00:24:15.640 --> 00:24:17.100
Spirits, fight!

